					Th.
					1.74
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τ. τινῶν</span> their
				<i>hardihood,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				102
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ -ότερον</span> your
				<i>greater daring,</i>
