			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. πολλὰ δρᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1117a2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κἂν εἰ -ότερον εἰρῆσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Sph.</u>
					267d
				</span></i>
			: also in Poets, <i><span class="en">
