				<u>Supp.</u>
				305
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				445
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Bion
				1.60
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνοίας οὐδὲν -ότερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					738
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔτολμος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Mon.</u>
				153
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.74
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				83
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				2.12
			</span></i>, etc.: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.126
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.17.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
				15.15
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					3.136
				</span></i>
			.</div>
